    "Quit that app, or lock and unlock your screen, to clear it.": {
      "comment": "Second line of the secure input warning: how to make the other app release secure input.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beende diese App oder sperre und entsperre den Bildschirm, um sie aufzuheben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit that app, or lock and unlock your screen, to clear it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
